repository-code: "https://github.com/ccmmf/cadwr-landuse"
abstract: >-
  Harmonized California Department of Water Resources (CADWR) 
  Statewide Crop Mapping data (LandIQ) for 2016-2023. This dataset 
  provides consistent field-level crop identification for ~600,000 
  agricultural fields across California, formatted for use in 
  carbon cycle modeling and ecosystem analysis.
keywords:
  - California
  - agriculture
  - crop mapping
  - LandIQ
  - carbon modeling
  - land use
  - CADWR
